<title>NORWAY: Norway 7-month c/a surplus 37.5 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway 7-month c/a surplus 37.5 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT			(billions of crowns)</p>
<p>			    Jan-July 1996     Jan-July 1995</p>
<p> Balance		     37.5		  21.1</p>
<p> Goods/services	    50.7		  37.1</p>
<p> Interest/other    minus 13.2	  minus 16.0</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
